{"vid":"YrMpcoOF-Xg","source":"YrMpcoOF-Xg.en.json3","lang":"en","cues":[{"t":0,"txt":"I received a $1 million investment."},{"t":3.6,"txt":">> We're talking to people who have had to"},{"t":4.9,"txt":"navigate unexpected career obstacles."},{"t":7.4,"txt":"What can you learn from [music] their"},{"t":8.9,"txt":"major career plays to score a goal in"},{"t":11.5,"txt":"this job market?"},{"t":14,"txt":">> I went from corporate to launching a"},{"t":15.9,"txt":"smoothie business called Jamba."},{"t":19.6,"txt":">> [music]"},{"t":20.1,"txt":">> I went from being a restaurant worker to"},{"t":22,"txt":"being one of Fox 1's chief World Cup"},{"t":24.7,"txt":"watcher."},{"t":25.5,"txt":">> [music]"},{"t":27.6,"txt":">> I went from being a philosophy major to"},{"t":30.2,"txt":"a professional cheesemonger."},{"t":32.1,"txt":">> [music]"},{"t":33.8,"txt":">> And I'm a full-time content creator. I'm"},{"t":35.7,"txt":"the Fox 1 chief World [music] Cup"},{"t":37,"txt":"watcher."},{"t":40.1,"txt":">> We're here with one of the Fox 1 chief"},{"t":42.2,"txt":"World Cup watchers, Kevin. He's getting"},{"t":44.4,"txt":"paid to watch every single match of the"},{"t":46.5,"txt":"tournament live right here in Times"},{"t":48.9,"txt":"Square."},{"t":49.7,"txt":">> Well, I think a lot of people know by"},{"t":51.1,"txt":"now that I've quit my job on my"},{"t":53.8,"txt":"restaurant job to be here. Yeah, so"},{"t":55.7,"txt":"before working in a restaurant, I was"},{"t":57.5,"txt":"working at a movie theater as a manager"},{"t":59.1,"txt":"for a very long time."},{"t":60.3,"txt":">> What was one of the first major plays"},{"t":62.3,"txt":"that changed the trajectory of your"},{"t":63.9,"txt":"career?"},{"t":64.6,"txt":">> It was around my mid-20s where I"},{"t":66.6,"txt":"mustered up the courage to go to my"},{"t":68.6,"txt":"leadership and pitch an idea to build"},{"t":70.9,"txt":"something from scratch. I was like,"},{"t":72.6,"txt":"\"Wow, I want to be an entrepreneur.\""},{"t":74.4,"txt":">> I always look back to when I was in"},{"t":75.6,"txt":"college. I went to one of my professors"},{"t":77.8,"txt":"and I was like, \"I How do I get an"},{"t":79.1,"txt":"internship?\" He's like, \"Would you want"},{"t":80.4,"txt":"to intern for me?\" So, I got this"},{"t":82,"txt":"amazing experience at a major sports"},{"t":84.8,"txt":"media company in New England."},{"t":86.1,"txt":">> When was the first moment that you"},{"t":87,"txt":"realized, \"I love cheese. This can be"},{"t":89.2,"txt":"work\"?"},{"t":89.6,"txt":">> It was making my very first batch of"},{"t":91,"txt":"cheese by myself. Kind of realized I"},{"t":93.5,"txt":"should do more with this. I read every"},{"t":95.3,"txt":"cheese book there is. The more you read,"},{"t":96.9,"txt":"the more you start getting into all"},{"t":98.2,"txt":"these different avenues like"},{"t":99.7,"txt":"microbiology"},{"t":101.4,"txt":"or even cheese philosophy."},{"t":103.3,"txt":">> All right, [music] and now it is time to"},{"t":105.1,"txt":"jump into our career red cards. This is"},{"t":108.4,"txt":"the moment we're going to talk about you"},{"t":109.6,"txt":"had any sort of career setback."},{"t":111.5,"txt":">> My senior year of college was during"},{"t":112.9,"txt":"COVID and I was like, \"How am I going to"},{"t":114.6,"txt":"have a job?\" And that's really when I"},{"t":116.6,"txt":"started hammering Tik Tok and Instagram"},{"t":119.5,"txt":"and posting relentlessly, and then that"},{"t":122.2,"txt":"turned into, you know, what I'm doing"},{"t":124.2,"txt":"now."},{"t":124.8,"txt":">> So, I had to get laid off and and"},{"t":127.4,"txt":"navigate that whole journey for the"},{"t":128.9,"txt":"first time. You can't help but think you"},{"t":131.1,"txt":"did something wrong, and that can be a"},{"t":133,"txt":"little hard on the ego, but it gave me a"},{"t":135.3,"txt":"lot of time to sit and figure out"},{"t":137.8,"txt":"exactly what I wanted to go do next and"},{"t":140,"txt":"land the next job in a better way."},{"t":142.2,"txt":">> COVID really turned everything around,"},{"t":144.5,"txt":"and it also got us to focus on what"},{"t":146.6,"txt":"matters the most. But, for an industry"},{"t":148.1,"txt":"that's so reliant on making a"},{"t":149.7,"txt":"face-to-face connection with people, it"},{"t":151.7,"txt":"was really hard to be isolated and still"},{"t":154.3,"txt":"translate the the power and the passion"},{"t":156.5,"txt":"of Behind the Cheese."},{"t":157.5,"txt":">> Things happen, and I had to pivot to the"},{"t":160,"txt":"point where I was out of a job for a"},{"t":161.4,"txt":"little bit. Just going through that time"},{"t":163,"txt":"period, I kept my mentality positive."},{"t":164.8,"txt":"Surrounding yourself with good people,"},{"t":166.2,"txt":"you know, just getting advice from"},{"t":167.7,"txt":"others who've been in the same position"},{"t":169.8,"txt":"as you."},{"t":170.4,"txt":">> So, you had to embrace the setback in"},{"t":171.7,"txt":"order to move forward. That's exactly"},{"t":173.4,"txt":"what I did."},{"t":174.2,"txt":">> [music]"},{"t":174.8,"txt":">> It's time to stop the clock because it's"},{"t":177.3,"txt":"time for our instant replay. I'm hoping"},{"t":179.6,"txt":"that you might have something to share"},{"t":181.4,"txt":"with us that might be reminiscent of"},{"t":183.1,"txt":"your journey."},{"t":183.7,"txt":">> Let's take it back with the audition"},{"t":185,"txt":"video. Excuse me for sounding selfish,"},{"t":186.8,"txt":"but I want that fan to be me."},{"t":188.6,"txt":">> Oh, I love your"},{"t":189.7,"txt":">> Yeah, as you can see, I got the big"},{"t":190.8,"txt":"soccer ball hat on. Like, I needed"},{"t":192.5,"txt":"something to make them notice me."},{"t":194.1,"txt":">> I have a fun photo, very special"},{"t":196.6,"txt":"screenshot moment from my big career"},{"t":199,"txt":"pivot. I was working on these big teams,"},{"t":201.1,"txt":"big brands, big facilities, to then"},{"t":203.8,"txt":"making smoothies out of my tiny little"},{"t":206.9,"txt":"kitchen with my hair net on, my apron,"},{"t":210,"txt":"my gloves."},{"t":212,"txt":">> Norway came for the tournament, and"},{"t":214.5,"txt":">> Oh, my god."},{"t":215.3,"txt":">> International Day of Yoga celebration,"},{"t":217.3,"txt":"one of my favorite pieces of content I"},{"t":218.9,"txt":"think I've ever made."},{"t":220.1,"txt":">> [music]"},{"t":220.7,"txt":">> It's time to talk about the career"},{"t":222.8,"txt":"goals. Can you tell me about when you"},{"t":224.3,"txt":"first landed your dream job?"},{"t":226.2,"txt":">> When I kind of realized that I have my"},{"t":228.4,"txt":"dream job was maybe 6 months ago. It was"},{"t":232,"txt":"taking a group of folks to go to"},{"t":234.2,"txt":"Switzerland to visit cheese producers."},{"t":235.8,"txt":"While we're visiting farms and going"},{"t":237.2,"txt":"having fun doing on the mountain, kind"},{"t":238.9,"txt":"of had a moment and I was like,"},{"t":240.9,"txt":"\"I'm on the clock and this is pretty"},{"t":242.3,"txt":"amazing.\""},{"t":243.1,"txt":">> I got the email saying that they wanted"},{"t":245.1,"txt":"to interview me for this role from Fox"},{"t":247.7,"txt":"1. That's when the interview happened"},{"t":249.5,"txt":"and then that's when I was notified that"},{"t":250.8,"txt":"I got the job. Like, I don't think the"},{"t":252.7,"txt":"younger version of me would be able to"},{"t":254.4,"txt":"fully"},{"t":255.5,"txt":"realize like the magnitude of this."},{"t":257.6,"txt":">> I had actually already started building"},{"t":259.4,"txt":"and working on Joba. I decided to raise"},{"t":262.1,"txt":"money and I was faced with a lot of no's"},{"t":264.3,"txt":"until that one call that came in. I"},{"t":266.6,"txt":"received a $1 million"},{"t":268.9,"txt":"investment in my company."},{"t":270.6,"txt":">> I feel like the only two things I ever"},{"t":272.2,"txt":"talked about when I was younger were"},{"t":273.4,"txt":"sports and comedy. So, I think oddly"},{"t":275.2,"txt":"enough, this job's been fantastic for me"},{"t":277.2,"txt":"cuz I've been able to kind of blend my"},{"t":278.9,"txt":"two passions together of being a"},{"t":281.1,"txt":"goofball and also watching sports. So,"},{"t":283.4,"txt":"it's been the perfect job."},{"t":285.7,"txt":">> For the job seekers who are out there"},{"t":286.8,"txt":"watching right now, what's your biggest"},{"t":288.4,"txt":"piece of advice?"},{"t":289.3,"txt":">> The main thing is consistency. Whether"},{"t":291,"txt":"it's, you know, shooting videos,"},{"t":292.4,"txt":"editing, you need to be on a consistent"},{"t":294,"txt":"format."},{"t":294.6,"txt":">> Just remember all of the past"},{"t":295.9,"txt":"accomplishments that you have."},{"t":297.3,"txt":">> Knowing the skills are transferable."},{"t":299,"txt":"What you want is to really develop those"},{"t":301.1,"txt":"skills into other avenues. Your past job"},{"t":303,"txt":"is probably giving you a lot more"},{"t":304.3,"txt":"experience than you remember."},{"t":305.6,"txt":">> So, my suggestion is start small. What's"},{"t":307.6,"txt":"the easiest baby step? Because if it's"},{"t":309.6,"txt":"your real passion, you will make time"},{"t":311.4,"txt":"for it."},{"t":311.8,"txt":">> I really think you have to just keep at"},{"t":313.7,"txt":"it and you're going to make a lot of"},{"t":315,"txt":"videos that don't get a lot of views."},{"t":316.6,"txt":"Keep tweaking and eventually you'll get"},{"t":318.4,"txt":"better at it and eventually you could be"},{"t":320.4,"txt":"in a box in Times Square watching all"},{"t":322.4,"txt":"104 matches."},{"t":324.4,"txt":">> If today's conversations have proved"},{"t":326.1,"txt":"anything, it's that there's more than"},{"t":327.6,"txt":"one path to finding your dream job. Make"},{"t":330.3,"txt":"sure you subscribe to Indeed's YouTube"},{"t":332.1,"txt":"channel for more helpful career tips."}],"words":[{"t":0,"w":"I"},{"t":0.24,"w":"received"},{"t":1.04,"w":"a"},{"t":1.2,"w":"$1"},{"